WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.080
Fire on board.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.608
Three reflexes that can save the crew.

3
00:00:05.858 --> 00:00:08.051
February nineteen ninety-seven.

4
00:00:08.051 --> 00:00:12.225
On the Mir space station, an oxygen
generator catches fire.

5
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.407
Smoke fills the module in seconds.

6
00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:19.276
Without gravity, it doesn't rise: the fans
spread it everywhere.

7
00:00:19.316 --> 00:00:23.032
The crew puts on masks, and fights the
fire for several minutes.

8
00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:27.730
Everyone survived, and the lessons became
three reflexes.

9
00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.010
Today, every crew trains for them.

10
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:34.525
One: alert. Press the fire alarm, and warn
everyone.

11
00:00:34.565 --> 00:00:36.991
Even if you're not sure: alert first.

12
00:00:37.891 --> 00:00:41.900
Two: gather. Put on your mask, and join
the crew at the safe spot.

13
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.697
Three: act. Cut the power to the smoking
rack,

14
00:00:45.697 --> 00:00:48.719
then use the extinguisher through its fire
port.

15
00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:53.425
Alert, gather, act. Practice it in the
fire simulation,

16
00:00:53.425 --> 00:00:55.293
until it becomes automatic.

